# exits 0 -- "0 passed; 31 filtered out" reads identically to a suite with no
# matching work to do. This journey lost that bet once: 8a73233c renamed the
# route test from eleven to thirteen routes and did not sweep this file, so
# every run since executed no route test at all and failed later, at a missing
# artifact, under a message about Secret file modes.
